  "question": "Where can I find the closest golf course toward the northeast of Out of Africa Wildlife Park, Camp Verde, AZ?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-111.9207 34.612641)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'golf_course'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
